@startuml state_frame_parser
!include _style.iuml
title State machine — UART frame parser (byte by byte)

[*] --> WAIT_SOF0
WAIT_SOF0 --> WAIT_SOF1 : byte == 0xA5
WAIT_SOF0 --> WAIT_SOF0 : other byte
WAIT_SOF1 --> TYPE : byte == 0x5A\n/ crc = 0xFFFF
WAIT_SOF1 --> WAIT_SOF1 : byte == 0xA5
WAIT_SOF1 --> WAIT_SOF0 : other byte
TYPE --> SEQ : / store, crc update
SEQ --> LEN_LO : / store, crc update
LEN_LO --> LEN_HI : / store, crc update
LEN_HI --> WAIT_SOF0 : [len > 12352]\n/ emit LEN_ERROR
LEN_HI --> PAYLOAD : [len > 0]
LEN_HI --> CRC_LO : [len == 0]
PAYLOAD --> PAYLOAD : [idx < len]\n/ store, crc update
PAYLOAD --> CRC_LO : [idx == len]
CRC_LO --> CRC_HI
CRC_HI --> WAIT_SOF0 : [crc ok] / emit FRAME
CRC_HI --> WAIT_SOF0 : [crc bad] / emit CRC_ERROR

note bottom of PAYLOAD
  Any state except WAIT_SOF0:
  no byte for > 50 ms => reset to WAIT_SOF0,
  emit TIMEOUT (FR-COM-04)
end note
@enduml
